      "individual_note": false,
      "resolvable": true,
      "resolved": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 594207513,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> Can we then just change to `size_t payload_len` in `export_object_entry_t` because of this?\n\nProbably, but to avoid narrowing complaints, assignments of `guint64`/`gint64` values to it would probably need to be protected by checks to make sure the value fits in a `size_t`.",
